              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Oyo eyaligho okuva eira n'eira yaidha, yaasala omusango, era abatukuvu b'oyo Ali Ghaigulu Yeene baagusinga. Era ekiseera kyamala kyatuuka abatukuvu abo baagheebwa obwakyabazinga.",
